y I mentioned before that my recent  videos have increased in quality I was  looking at my older videos the other day  and I don't know why they got so many  views my microphone was terrible my  narration was really melodramatic and I  didn't have nearly the same amount of  skill in gathering footage I'm speaking  mostly about my first few prepare to cry  videos with the prepare to cry series I  focused on the best stories first like  Artorias siegmeyer the sisters of chaos  those were the three most emotional  stories in the game so naturally I did  them first the problem with that is that  now that my video quality has improved  the three best stories were done when I  just wasn't really experienced so I  think I'll redo those videos I won't  delete them but I'll remake them with  new footage better narration and just  better overall quality would you guys  like that let me know so that pretty  much does it for this video the rest of  the video is just me trying to take out  the Taurus demon if you want to see how  that ends feel free to stick around but  um if you haven't subscribed already  feel free to subscribe at the next few  videos I'm going to be putting out are  also mod videos showcasing two more mods  that I actually think are better than  this mod if you can believe it  so as usual guys thanks for watching and  I'll see you guys next time  you  you  you  you  you
 

